            },
            {
              "title": "Health Insurance and Childcare Costs:",
              "snippet": "These costs are also factored into the overall support obligation.",
              "reference_indexes": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Proportionate Share:",
              "snippet": "The court will then determine each parent's proportionate share of the combined income and the corresponding share of the child support obligation.",
              "reference_indexes": [
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "No Waiver:",
              "snippet": "Parents cannot waive their obligation to pay child support, according to Goldberg Simpson.",
